
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Islamic Community</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  background: linear-gradient(160deg,#001d16,#064b35,#001a13);
  color: white;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  text-align: center;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

.card {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 400px;
  padding: 35px 22px;
  border: 1px solid #c9a64b;
  border-radius: 22px;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
  box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(201,166,75,.2);
}

.allah {
  font-size: 85px;
  color: #f4d477;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  text-shadow: 0 0 20px #c9a64b;
}

h1 {
  color: #f4d477;
  font-size: 27px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

p {
  color: #e5e5e5;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.join {
  display: block;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg,#c49b37,#f4d477);
  color: #00251a;
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 16px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 18px;
}

.join:hover {
  transform: scale(1.03);
}

.footer {
  margin-top: 25px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #c9c9c9;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

<div class="allah">الله</div>

<h1>Welcome To Our Community</h1>

<p>
Assalamu Alaikum ❤️<br>
Join our Telegram community and stay connected.
</p>

<a class="join"
href="https://t.me/+MehnlSBUyS9jNjQ9"
target="_blank">
✈ JOIN TELEGRAM NOW
</a>

<div class="footer">
May Allah bless you 🤍
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
